During every full default run, the parent (80-129) spawns current_exe with no thread limit, so each selected control runs twice at once. This includes:
- the 16-operation saturation and 30ms admission controls (202-257, 473-552, 1289-1355);
- the real /bin/ps 250ms macOS PERM branch (133-180);
- the Generic/Context fixtures and the Grok reader actors.

A flaky failure in either copy fails the gate; in the child it surfaces through the assertion at 107-110. The fd406 full Debug (312/2) and Release (308/6) results include this load; 35f0 did not. No impact analysis or diagnostic comparison is recorded. No causal role is inferred here.
